ass="inner_column size_large family_lato"><div id="header" class="header"><h1 itemprop="name" class="game_title">PingBlip</h1></div><div id="view_html_game_3140349" class="view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready"><div id="html_embed_8665961" class="html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper"><div data-width="1024" data-height="720" style="width: 1024px; height: 720px" class="game_frame game_loaded"><button title="Enter fullscreen" class="fullscreen_btn"><img src="https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1793270461"/></button><iframe id="game_drop" allowtransparency="true" webkitallowfullscreen="true" mozallowfullscreen="true" msallowfullscreen="true" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" src="https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19766176/index.html?v=1792009530" allow="autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share"></iframe></div></div><div class="columns"><div class="left_col column"><div class="formatted_description user_formatted"><p></p>
<p>Something pinged. It&#x27;s yours now.</p>
<p>PingBlip is a free creature collector that runs in your browser. Today&#x27;s real weather decides which of 80 odd little creatures hatches for you. You feed it with live readings from real sensors. If you forget it, it falls asleep, but it never dies. There are no loot boxes, no sign-up and no download.</p>
<p>Share your creature with a friend: when they hatch theirs from your link, you both get pips.</p>
<p>Controls: mouse or touch. Desktop and mobile browsers.</p></div><div class="more_information_toggle"><div class="toggle_row"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="toggle_info_btn">More information<svg height="6" width="12" class="svgicon icon_down_tick" role="img" aria-hidden viewBox="0 0 37 20" version="1.1"><path d="m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z"/></svg></a></div><div class="info_panel_wrapper"><div id="game_info_panel_4124365" class="game_info_panel_widget base_widget"><table><tbody><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title="14 October 2026 @ 20:26 UTC"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-stopwatch"></span> 14 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/games/released">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/games/html5">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href="https://pingblip.itch.io">PingBlip</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation">Simulation</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/games/tag-cozy">Cozy</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/games/tag-creature-collector">creature-collector</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/games/tag-virtual-pet">Virtual Pet</a></td></tr><tr><td>AI Disclosure</td><td><a href="https://itch.io/games/ai-assisted">AI Assisted</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/games/ai-code">Code</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/games/ai-graphics">Graphics</a>, <a href="https://itch.io/games/ai-text">Text</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id="game_comments_1365345" class="game_comments_widget base_widget"><h2 id="comments">Leave a comment</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fpingblip.itch.io%2Fpingblip" dat